The revolution is a 2/4 beat in the key of truth

[Outro]
The last waltz the last waltz
The accordion breathes its fire one last time
Uno dos tres
LYRICS

echo "Generating: Apocalyptic Polka-Punk..."
mmx music generate \
  --prompt "Raucous carnival of destruction, oompah tubas marching with distorted electric guitars, crashing cymbals, accordion fed through fuzz pedal, rebellious Eastern European folk-punk in a burning warehouse, polka-punk" \
  --lyrics-file polka-lyrics.txt \
  --bpm 130 \
  --key "E minor" \
  --out "${OUTDIR}/m3-03-apocalyptic-polka-punk.mp3" \
  --quiet --yes 2>/dev/null && \
  echo "  ✓ m3-03-apocalyptic-polka-punk.mp3 ($(stat -c%s ${OUTDIR}/m3-03-apocalyptic-polka-punk.mp3) bytes)" || \
  echo "  ✗ m3-03 FAILED"

# 4. Deep-Sea Bossa Nova Vaporwave
cat > deepsea-lyrics.txt << 'LYRICS'
[Verse 1]
Ten thousand meters below your heart
The coral sings blues on Tuesday
My love is a submarine submerged in blue
Catching signals of you through the hull

[Chorus]
Pinging pinging can I find you
Neon vapor floats on the sea
Each sonar is an I love you I sent
Back to the surface maybe someday I'll return

[Verse 2]
The anglerfish are dancing in bioluminescent gowns
The pressure here could crush every memory I've found
But your voice comes through the water distorted and sweet
A bossa nova current from the surface world's heartbeat

[Chorus]
Pinging pinging can I find you
Neon vapor floats on the sea
Each sonar is an I love you I sent
Back to the surface maybe someday I'll return

[Bridge]
The whale song harmonizes with the sonar ping
A love letter traveling at the speed of sound through everything
Slowed and chopped and drowning in reverb
The ocean is a remix of the sky above

[Outro]
Ping
Ping
Ping
Maybe someday
LYRICS

echo "Generating: Deep-Sea Bossa Nova Vaporwave..."
mmx music generate \
  --prompt "Underwater lounge, gentle bossa nova guitar with slowed chopped vaporwave samples, sonar pings as percussion, whale songs as backing vocals, deep reverb, bioluminescent atmosphere, Portuguese-tinged vocal" \
  --lyrics-file deepsea-lyrics.txt \
  --bpm 85 \
  --key "F major" \
  --out "${OUTDIR}/m3-04-deep-sea-bossa-vaporwave.mp3" \
  --quiet --yes 2>/dev/null && \
  echo "  ✓ m3-04-deep-sea-bossa-vaporwave.mp3 ($(stat -c%s ${OUTDIR}/m3-04-deep-sea-bossa-vaporwave.mp3) bytes)" || \
  echo "  ✗ m3-04 FAILED"

# 5. Glitch-Hop Celtic Reels
cat > glitch-celtic-lyrics.txt << 'LYRICS'
[Verse 1]
Aye the loch's got Wi-Fi now Nessie's on the grid
Bagpipes in the mainframe lad did ye what I did
I coded up a reel in C minor broke the kilts
The sheep are doing dubstep the heather's built in stilts

[Chorus]
Highland highland hit the ceilidh glitch
Harpsichord's corrupted in the ditch
Caledonia meets the motherboard's scream
We're the glitched-out heirs of every Highland dream

[Verse 2]
The piper's got a laptop and the drone's connected
Every ancient melody has been redirected
Through a bit-crusher and a tape delay
